  "description": "Model War Date: 10th & 11th October 2026 Model War is an AI-powered competitive event where participants enhance a pre-built autonomous bot and pit their models against each other in a real-time Rocket League-style tournament. Each bot independently analyzes the game environment, manages resources, makes strategic decisions, and competes against opposing models. Participants can leverage Machine Learning, Reinforcement Learning, search algorithms, or traditional AI strategies to optimize their bots and gain a competitive edge. All matches will be showcased through a live graphical interface, bringing AI-driven competition to life. The objective is simple: build the smartest model, outplay the competition, and become the ultimate Model War champion. Guidelines Modify and optimize the provided baseline bot using AI/ML or custom strategies. Bots must operate fully autonomously during matches. Compete in a Rocket League-style tournament against other participants. Submit your final bot/model before the specified deadline. Manual intervention, cheating, or game exploitation is strictly prohibited. Winners will be determined based on match performance and tournament results. The organizers’ decision will be final.",
